#: src/main.ui:445
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Eng Desktop Notifikatioun weist während Ubuntu Hello no Ärem Gesiicht sicht, "
"da bericht d'Resultat. Ausgefall Versich bleiwen an der Notifikatioun Lëscht."

#: src/main.ui:476
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Show Notifikatiounen"

#: src/main.ui:482
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
"Eng Kaart pro Gesiicht Authentifikatioun Versuch, am Plaz aktualiséiert mam "
"Resultat."

#: src/main.ui:513
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Notifikatioun kléngt"

#: src/main.ui:519
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Spillt de System Sound fir eng unerkannt oder gescheitert Versuch."

#: src/main.ui:550
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Diagnostik enthalen"

#: src/main.ui:556
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Füügt de Modell, Sécherheet vs Schwell, Rummen, Kamera an Timing op all "
"Kaart. Nëtzlech wann Dir e Problem bericht."

#: src/main.ui:618 src/main.ui:734
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Sécherheet"

#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"Wéi genee Äert Gesiicht iwwereneestëmme muss, an ob Ubuntu Hello Iech freet "
"ze bestätegen, datt Dir wierklech do sidd."

#: src/main.ui:657
msgid "Face match strictness"
msgstr "Strengheet vun der Gesiichtserkennung"

#: src/main.ui:665 src/onboarding.ui:151
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Schnell"

#: src/main.ui:672 src/onboarding.ui:182
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Equilibréiert"

#: src/main.ui:680 src/onboarding.ui:213
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Séchert"

#: src/main.ui:702 src/onboarding.ui:250
msgid "Ask me to nod to confirm"
msgstr "Mech froen ze nécken fir ze bestätegen"

#: src/main.ui:708 src/onboarding.ui:259
msgid ""
"After your face matches, a notification asks you to nod. A photo held up to "
"the camera cannot nod."
msgstr ""
"Wann Äert Gesiicht erkannt gouf, freet Iech eng Notifikatioun ze nécken. E "
"Foto, deen een virun d'Kamera hält, kann net nécken."

#: src/main.ui:771 src/onboarding.ui:759
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Schlësselring / KWallet Auto-Spär"

#: src/main.ui:786
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Aktivéiert Gesiichtsauthentifikatioun fir automatesch Äre Login "
"Schlësselring oder KWallet beim Login opzemaachen. Dëst späichert Äert "
"Passwuert sécher am TPM versiegelt wann et verfügbar ass, oder verschlësselt "
"mat AES-256-GCM mat engem root-nëmmen Master-Schlëssel. Face Auth setzt "
"PAM_AUTHTOK fir pam_gnome_keyring oder pam_kwallet5 ofhängeg vun Ärem "
"Desktop."

