"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/ubuntu-hello\">Open GitHub link</a> "
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/ubuntu-hello\">GitHub Link opmaachen</"
"a>"

#: src/main.ui:1020
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/Ubuntu-Hello/issues\">Report a problem "
"or suggest a feature</a>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://github.com/ventura8/Ubuntu-Hello/issues\">E Problem mellen "
"oder eng Feature proposéieren</a>"

#: src/main.ui:1032
msgid "About"
msgstr "Iwwer"

#: src/onboarding.ui:9 src/onboarding.ui:14
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello"
msgstr "Wëllkomm op Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/onboarding.ui:52
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "Setup ass gemaach!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:68
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing anything "
"you would normally have to type your password for to authenticate, like "
"running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unlock, your login "
"keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically on login.\n"
"\n"
"You can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to change more advanced "
"settings or add additional models. Press Finish below to close this window "
"and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Mir si fäerdeg! Ubuntu Hello ass elo op dësem Computer aktiv. Probéiert "
"alles ze maachen, fir datt Dir normalerweis Äert Passwuert aginn fir ze "
"authentifizéieren, wéi e Kommando mat sudo ze lafen. Wann Dir d'Auto-Spär "
"vun der Schlësselring aktivéiert hutt, gëtt Äre Login-Schlësselring oder "
"KWallet och automatesch beim Login opgehuewen.\n"
"\n"
"Dir kënnt den Ubuntu Hello Configurator spéider opmaachen fir méi "
"fortgeschratt Astellungen z'änneren oder zousätzlech Modeller derbäizefügen. "
"Press Finish ënnendrënner fir dës Fënster zouzemaachen an den Ubuntu Hello "
"Configurator opzemaachen."

#: src/onboarding.ui:105
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Eng Sécherheetspolitik setzen"

#: src/onboarding.ui:121
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match is "
"never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you can set "
"how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Wéinst Ännerungen am Winkel, Distanz an aner Faktoren ass e Gesiichtsmatch "
"ni genau d'selwecht wéi de gespäichert Gesiichtsmodell. Op dëser Säit kënnt "
"Dir astellen wéi strikt Ubuntu Hello soll sinn."

#: src/onboarding.ui:160
msgid ""
"The most forgiving match and the quickest to let you in. Choose this if "
"convenience matters more than strictness."
msgstr ""
"Déi toleranteste Erkennung an de séierste Wee eran. Wielt dëst, wann Iech "
"Komfort méi wichteg ass wéi Strengheet."

#: src/onboarding.ui:191
msgid ""
"A strict match that still logs you in quickly. It may not recognise you at a "
"sharp angle or from further away."
msgstr ""
"Eng streng Erkennung, déi Iech trotzdem séier ulogge léisst. Aus engem "
"staarke Wénkel oder vu wäitem erkennt si Iech vläicht net."

#: src/onboarding.ui:223
msgid "The strictest match, with no extra step when you log in. Recommended."
msgstr ""
"Déi strengste Erkennung, ouni zousätzleche Schrëtt beim Uloggen. Empfohlen."

#: src/onboarding.ui:379
msgid "Skip for now"
msgstr "Elo mol iwwersprangen"

#: src/onboarding.ui:384
msgid ""
"You can add more face models later from Settings or with: sudo ubuntu-hello "
"add"
msgstr ""
"Dir kënnt spéider an den Astellungen oder mat „sudo ubuntu-hello add“ weider "
"Gesiichtsmodeller dobäisetzen"

#: src/onboarding.ui:403 src/onboarding.ui:531
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Webcam konfiguréieren"

#: src/onboarding.ui:435
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
msgstr "Blénkt den Infrarout-Emitter?"

#: src/onboarding.ui:447
msgid ""
"Look at the camera you selected: an infrared camera shows a small light that "
"blinks while Ubuntu Hello tests it. This tells us whether it can see your "
"face in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Kuckt d'Kamera déi Dir gewielt hutt: eng Infraroutkamera weist e klengt "
"Liicht dat blénkt wärend Ubuntu Hello et testt. Dëst seet eis ob et Äert "
"Gesiicht am Däischteren gesinn kann."

#: src/onboarding.ui:481
msgid "Yes, it flashes"
msgstr "Jo, et blénkt"

#: src/onboarding.ui:507
msgid "No, nothing flashes"
msgstr "Nee, näischt blénkt"

#: src/onboarding.ui:547
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available "
"cameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list of "
"usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and click Next."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello sicht Äre System automatesch no verfügbare Kameraen, also "
"vergewëssert Iech datt Är Webcam ugeschloss ass. No der Detektioun gëtt eng "
"Lëscht mat benotzbaren Webcams gewisen. Wielt deen deen Dir benotze wëllt a "
"klickt Next."

#: src/onboarding.ui:566
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Testt Är Webcams, waart w.e.g. ..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:613
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Eroflueden Datendateien"

#: src/onboarding.ui:629
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be able "
"to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the download "
"progress below."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello brauch dräi pre-trainéiert Gesiichtserkennungsdatesets fir Iech "
"z'erkennen, déi elo erofgeluede ginn. Dir kënnt den Download Fortschrëtt hei "
"ënnen gesinn."

#: src/onboarding.ui:653
msgid "Starting download..."
msgstr "Start eroflueden ..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:697
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello!"
msgstr "Wëllkomm op Ubuntu Hello!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:709
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Versioun"

#: src/onboarding.ui:723
msgid ""
"This wizard will walk you through the setup process and automatically "
"configure Ubuntu Hello for you. Press next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Dëse Wizard féiert Iech duerch de Setupprozess an konfiguréiert automatesch "
"Ubuntu Hello fir Iech. Press nächst fir weiderzemaachen."

#: src/onboarding.ui:775
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet using "
"face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kann Äre Login-Schlësselring automatesch opspären oder KWallet "
"mat Gesiichtsauthentifikatioun, verhënnert Passwuertprompts nodeems Dir Iech "
"ugemellt hutt."

#: src/onboarding.ui:787
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Aktivéiert automatesch Schlësselring / KWallet Spär"

#: src/onboarding.ui:815
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Confirméieren Passwuert"

#: src/onboarding.ui:872
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Zréck"

#: src/onboarding.ui:907
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "Setup fäerdeg"

#: src/onboarding.ui:934
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Nächst"

#: ubuntu-hello-gtk.desktop.in
msgid "Windows Hello style facial authentication"
msgstr "Windows Hello Stil Gesiichtsauthentifikatioun"

#: ubuntu-hello-gtk.desktop.in
msgid "face;recognition;authentication;security;lock;"
msgstr "Gesiicht; Unerkennung; Authentifikatioun; Sécherheet; Spär;"
